  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat. ",
    "Add cumin seeds and coriander seeds. ",
    "Once the seeds start crackling, add onions and sauté until they are translucent. ",
    "Add tomatoes, carrots, red chilies, curry leaves, turmeric powder, and salt. ",
    "Sauté for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10-12 minutes, or until the mixture thickens.",
    "Stir in beurre-monte and ghee.",
    "Cook for a further 2-3 minutes, or until the sambhar is heated through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh coriander leaves if desired."
  ],
